ay","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"21:3","t":"With their hearts distracted. And those who do wrong conceal their private conversation, [saying], \"Is this [Prophet] except a human being like you? So would you approach magic while you are aware [of it]?\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"21:4","t":"He [the Prophet (ﷺ)] said, \"My Lord knows whatever is said throughout the heaven and earth, and He is the Hearing, the Knowing.\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"21:5","t":"But they say, \"[The revelation is but] a mixture of false dreams; rather, he has invented it; rather, he is a poet. So let him bring us a sign just as the previous [messengers] were sent [with miracles].\"","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"21:6","t":"Not a [single] city which We destroyed believed before them, so will they believe?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"21:7","t":"And We sent not before you, [O Muḥammad], except men to whom We revealed [the message], so ask the people of the message [i.e., former scriptures] if you do not know.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"21:8","t":"And We did not make them [i.e., the prophets] forms not eating food, nor were they immortal [on earth].","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"21:9","t":"Then We fulfilled for them the promise, and We saved them and whom We willed and destroyed the transgressors.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"21:10","t":"We have certainly sent down to you a Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] in which is your mention. Then will you not reason?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":10,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}